id: pm-starter-cz6b
title: Certify pm-starter on PM CLI/SDK 2026.10.4 and consolidate pending dependency updates
description: "The published agent starter still exact-pins CLI SDK, pm-ops and pm-changelog 2026.9.23. Upgrade to the latest published compatible releases, keep the canonical merge-driver launcher aligned, test the package gate and packed npm/Bun use, and record exact-head review/privacy limits."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[3]: agent-starter,"area:quality","area:toolchain"
created_at: "2026-09-29T14:48:42.416Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-04T12:15:35.712Z"
author: codex
estimated_minutes: 150
acceptance_criteria: "CLI SDK exact-pins 2026.10.4 and release helpers pin their latest published compatible versions; lockfile and merge-driver launcher match published artifacts; direct and PM-linked release gate pass with exact totals, no skipped tests and explicit coverage scope; fresh packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx acceptance runs on CLI 2026.10.4; strict PM health and GitHub checks pass; public history privacy and substantive bot review blockers stay explicit before merge or publication."
risk: medium
confidence: high
unblock_note: Resume current SDK dependency certification; coverage completeness remains separately tracked in pm-starter-puy5.
actual_result: "PM CLI/SDK, pm-ops and pm-changelog 2026.10.4; current exact dev pins, npm/Bun locks and Dependabot #117 #120 #121 exact CodeQL SHA consolidated. Test-first complete-reader fix preserves full rows and bodies beyond default budget; peer/manifest floor 2026.8.15 kept after flag verification. Locked final release:check PASS 200/200 zero skipped; 100% lines/branches/functions over 3 configured sources; docstrings 6 files/32 declarations. Audits zero; strict health exit zero with inherited stale advisory. Packed copied-real-tracker npx/native Bun 7-command dogfood PASS; demo/summary/export 71 items each, keyword search returns coverage issue pm-starter-puy5 in both runtimes. Scratch deleted; GitHub dry-run planned zero writes. Coverage completeness/statements remain open in pm-starter-puy5. Exact evidence docs/certification-2026.10.4.md and linked dogfood log. Final-head CI/reviews separate; no merge/closure. Full PM-linked locked release:check PASS 200/200 zero skips using explicit tracker context and source workspace; source/none refused and snapshot/none lacks Git metadata. Existing result-tracking policy disabled; outcome recorded manually."
